# The build context is the repository root, because the runtime image installs
# the census2-dataset-writer and census2-sdk packages. Everything a build does not
# read stays out of the context, the Nextflow work and output directories included.
.git
.github
**/.nf-test
**/.nf-test.log
**/nf-test
**/work
**/out
**/reports
**/.nextflow
**/.nextflow.log*
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/build
**/.venv
**/.venv-*
*.zip
*.jsonl
